{
  "_readme": [
    "Ground truth for scoring candidate NBA data sources.",
    "",
    "`current_pool_teams` is what backend/nba_players.json claims today, which is",
    "the thing under suspicion -- it is here to be checked, not trusted.",
    "",
    "To verify one entry: look the player up on Basketball-Reference, read the",
    "season-by-season team column, collapse consecutive seasons at the same",
    "franchise into one entry, keep a later return as a separate entry, and use",
    "the franchise name as it was AT THE TIME (Seattle SuperSonics, not Oklahoma",
    "City). Put the result in `verified_teams` and set `verified` to true.",
    "",
    "Entries with verified=false are ignored when scoring a source, so this file",
    "is useful from the first entry filled in rather than only when complete."
  ],
